title: tutorial_basics
---
Elder Guardian: Use Arrow Keys to move. Press Z to jump and Left Shift to run. Press C to dash. Open controls anytime with F1.
-> What else should I know?
    <<jump combat_tips>>
-> Tell me about this place
    <<jump hub_lore>>
-> Thanks, I'm ready now
    <<stop>>
===
title: combat_tips
---
Elder Guardian: Press X for melee, S to guard/parry, and A to switch Yin/Yang stance. Press O to open the mission board if you lose track of objectives.
-> Any other advice?
    <<jump final_advice>>
-> Tell me about this place
    <<jump hub_lore>>
-> I understand, thank you
    <<stop>>
===
title: final_advice
---
Elder Guardian: Explore every room, defeat enemies for health potions, and seek out the mission givers. They will test your skills!
-> Anything else?
    <<jump greeting>>
-> I'm ready to begin
    <<stop>>
===
title: hub_lore
---
Elder Guardian: This is the Central Hub, a safe haven for ninjas. From here, portals lead to different regions. Each holds unique challenges and treasures.
-> What are the regions?
    <<jump regions_info>>
-> How do I progress?
    <<jump progression_info>>
-> Thanks for the info
    <<jump greeting>>
===
title: regions_info
---
Elder Guardian: The Forest is for beginners. Then comes the Town, Caves, Castle, and finally the dark Sewers. Each region grows more dangerous.
-> How do I unlock them?
    <<jump progression_info>>
-> I see. What else?
    <<jump hub_lore>>
-> I understand
    <<jump greeting>>
===
title: progression_info
---
Elder Guardian: Complete missions from NPCs to unlock new regions. Collect abilities, upgrade your gear, and grow stronger with each victory!
-> Tell me more about regions
    <<jump regions_info>>
-> Anything else?
    <<jump hub_lore>>
-> Thanks, I'm ready
    <<stop>>
===
title: adventure_ready
---
Elder Guardian: Your courage is admirable! Seek out the mission givers throughout the hub. They will guide you to your first trials. May fortune favor you!
<<fire_event tutorial_completed>>
<<stop>>
